ices, private jet charter services, aircraft management services; and aircraft maintenance, repair and overhaul services. It operates in Malaysia, Singapore, China, Hong Kong, Japan, Korea, Vietnam, Taiwan, Germany, Luxembourg, Netherlands, Russian, Switzerland, Oman, Qatar, the United Arab Emirates, Dubai, Australia, Turkey, and the United States. The company was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Shah Alam, Malaysia.","zh":"Sin-Kung Logistics Berhad 是一家综合物流服务提供商，成立于1994年，总部位于马来西亚莎阿南，业务覆盖马来西亚、新加坡、中国、香港、日本、韩国、越南、台湾、德国、卢森堡、荷兰、俄罗斯、瑞士、阿曼、卡塔尔、阿联酋、迪拜、澳大利亚、土耳其和美国等多个国家和地区。","lines":["卡车运输服务：提供以机场到机场道路接驳服务为重点的卡车运输，客户为航空货运相关企业。","集装箱拖运、仓储配送及其他物流相关服务：提供集装箱运输、仓储和配送等综合物流服务。","经纪与货运代理及快递服务：提供货运经纪、代理和快递配送服务，并包括货物押运服务。","航空货运与包机服务：提供航空货运、私人飞机包机及飞机管理服务。","飞机维修服务：提供飞机维护、维修和大修（MRO）服务。"],"lines_en":["Trucking services: Provides trucking with a focus on airport-to-airport road feeder services for air cargo-related customers.","Container haulage, warehousing and distribution, and other logistics-related services: Offers container transport, warehousing, distribution and other integrated logistics services.","Brokerage and forwarding services, and express delivery services: Provides freight brokerage, forwarding and express delivery, as well as cargo escort services.","Air cargo and charter services: Offers air cargo services, private jet charter services and aircraft management services.","Aircraft maintenance services: Provides aircraft maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) services."]}}